     \\  glm-latent-rows           TF_GLM_OVN_LATENT_ROWS: absorb_q and expand_v at 2 and 4 rows a loop step against today's, byte for byte
     \\  glm-mla-skip-check        TF_GLM_OVN_MLA_FUSEMERGE: the bounded and fused chunk launches against today's, byte for byte
